WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:04.770
I have a very strange video that is quickly
becoming one of my favorite clips of the week.

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:07.569
This is I don't even know how to explain this.

00:00:07.569 --> 00:00:11.860
Donald Trump did an event yesterday instead
of just hiding.

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:13.489
It was good to see him do something.

00:00:13.489 --> 00:00:19.220
He did a Presidential Medal of Freedom ceremony
for Dan Gable, who's a wrestler and coach.

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:25.880
And as the event was sort of winding down,
the press assembled and was starting to ask

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:28.020
Trump questions.

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:32.619
And in the video I'm going to play for you,
you will hear a question asked of Donald Trump

00:00:32.619 --> 00:00:35.980
about whether he will go to Joe Biden's inauguration.

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:41.120
And Trump just sort of looked around confused,
I guess, realized he didn't want to answer

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:43.850
that question and just walked out of the room.

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:48.920
And you can tell from the video that people
are confused about why Donald Trump is leaving.

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:54.351
And the camera, weirdly cuts to Dan Gable,
who's the presidential medal honoree, who

00:00:54.351 --> 00:01:02.140
looks very confused and says he's gone because
clearly no one expected such an abrupt ending

00:01:02.140 --> 00:01:06.370
to this event at some of the strangest behavior
we've seen.

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:07.480
Take a look at this.

00:01:07.480 --> 00:01:08.790
It's just absolute gold.

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:11.400
Of course, about the inauguration.

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:19.290
Fact, I'm Bill Barker.

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:25.210
Congratulations on everything.

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:31.530
It really seems like the Curb Your Enthusiasm
theme should be playing as Donald Trump walks

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:37.230
out, it's comical and bizarre and unexplainable
all at once.

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:39.560
And the simplest explanation is Trump.

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:44.880
Trump continues not to want to answer questions
like do you admit you lost?

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:50.060
And do you concede that Joe Biden will be
president and will you be going to the inauguration?

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:54.060
And there was really no way to stay in the
room without answering the questions as far

00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:55.610
as Trump was concerned.

00:01:55.610 --> 00:02:00.790
But the truth is, a real president could have
handled this very easily and stayed in the

00:02:00.790 --> 00:02:02.860
room without answering those questions.

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:07.670
Trump could have said, hey, listen, guys,
we're here today to honor Dan.

00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:10.489
We're celebrating Dan's incredible accomplishments.

00:02:10.489 --> 00:02:13.359
I don't know what they are, but but he presumably
does.

00:02:13.359 --> 00:02:15.590
I'm just not familiar with Dan Gable.

00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:18.670
And he could say this isn't the time for politics.

00:02:18.670 --> 00:02:20.780
It's not a time for questions.

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:21.879
Thank you very much.

00:02:21.879 --> 00:02:26.379
You're still avoiding the questions, but you're
doing it in a slightly more reasonable way.

00:02:26.379 --> 00:02:29.110
Trump can't do it, or at least he doesn't
behave in that way.

00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:33.749
And instead, just kind of bizarrely wanders
off, leaving a room full of people.

00:02:33.749 --> 00:02:36.420
And everything about this event was it was
a total farce.

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:40.930
At one point, while the event is going on,
there's a little kid laying down.

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:44.170
Looks like he's sleeping in the back of the
Oval Office or whatever room.

00:02:44.170 --> 00:02:46.689
This was an all completely bizarre.

00:02:46.689 --> 00:02:51.370
And of course, Trump supporters will defend
him no matter what and say, well, listen,

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:57.010
the fake news media was throwing unfair mean
questions at him.

00:02:57.010 --> 00:03:00.049
It was presidential harassment.

00:03:00.049 --> 00:03:05.880
And if you think that's crazy, Dan Gable was
actually interviewed this morning about this

00:03:05.880 --> 00:03:07.489
bizarre event.

00:03:07.489 --> 00:03:11.450
And he essentially said that, which was Trump
didn't want to answer those questions.

00:03:11.450 --> 00:03:12.450
Truly strange times.

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:13.450
Take a look.

00:03:13.450 --> 00:03:17.159
I think Donald Trump really respects me.

00:03:17.159 --> 00:03:19.319
He's always been humbled in front of me.

00:03:19.319 --> 00:03:21.659
He's never made me mad.

00:03:21.659 --> 00:03:27.060
He might have walked out of the press conference
a little bit yesterday, a little bit perturbed

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:29.730
with a couple of news people, newspaper people.

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:32.640
But but, hey, I was having a great time.

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:35.810
He left you in the office by yourself with
your family.

00:03:35.810 --> 00:03:37.499
So that's OK.

00:03:37.499 --> 00:03:40.540
He he he was didn't like what was going on.

00:03:40.540 --> 00:03:43.279
He said it was about me and it wasn't about
him.

00:03:43.279 --> 00:03:45.129
So he's I'm out of there.

00:03:45.129 --> 00:03:46.129
You got it.

00:03:46.129 --> 00:03:47.129
No, I hear you.

00:03:47.129 --> 00:03:48.439
And you have the matter with you.

00:03:48.439 --> 00:03:49.439
I, I do.

00:03:49.439 --> 00:03:50.439
Right here.

00:03:50.439 --> 00:03:51.519
Can we sit right here.

00:03:51.519 --> 00:03:52.519
Yeah.

00:03:52.519 --> 00:03:53.930
Yeah, right here.

00:03:53.930 --> 00:03:57.980
It's it's President's Medal of Freedom right
here.

00:03:57.980 --> 00:03:58.980
Yeah.

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:03.349
So what a weird timeline that we are in.

00:04:03.349 --> 00:04:08.030
And I know some people have been writing to
me saying Trump is comedy gold.

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:12.219
David, I'm really going to miss Trump when
he leaves office.

00:04:12.219 --> 00:04:17.870
Stuff like this, I guess, is funny in a in
a relatively benign way.

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:20.090
And I will sort of miss it.

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:23.240
But the country and the world are going to
be so much better off with Trump gone and

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:42.450
we're down to just six weeks.

00:04:42.450 --> 00:05:04.720
We're 

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:34.520
all looking forward to it.

